What if you want your comments to be on multiple lines?

# comment
# comment line 2
# comment line 3
You can use this by using three consecutive single ' or double quotes " to surround your comment

This works

''' This is the beginning 
of a multi-line comment.
Notice that none of this code will run '''
And this works

""" This is the beginning 
of a multi-line comment.
Notice that none of this code will run """
But mixing single and double quotes doesn't work

""" This is the beginning 
of a multi-line comment.
Notice that none of this code will run '''

# Convert this 
# to a multiline 
# quote using single or double quotes

"""Convert this 
to a multiline 
quote using single or double quotes"""
